{"enapa dvitiya": [{"id": "enapA dvitIyA", "headword": "एनपा द्वितीया", "headword_slp1": "enapA dvitIyA", "fold": "enapa dvitiya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "With a word ending with the affix एनाप् -- एनबन्यतरस्यामदूरेऽपञ्चम्याः ५.३.३५, the 2nd case-affix is used, as well as the 6th.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-2, 6", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["एनपा द्वितीया २.३.३१", "२.३.३१", "२.३.३१ एनपा द्वितीया"], "synonyms_slp1": ["enapA dvitIyA २.३.३१", "२.३.३१", "२.३.३१ enapA dvitIyA"]}], "enabanyatarasyamadurepaYcamyaH": [{"id": "enabanyatarasyAmadUre'paYcamyAH", "headword": "एनबन्यतरस्यामदूरेऽपञ्चम्याः", "headword_slp1": "enabanyatarasyAmadUre'paYcamyAH", "fold": "enabanyatarasyamadurepaYcamyaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix एनप् (एन) comes optionally after the words 1. उत्तर and 2. दक्षिण in the sense of अस्ताति, when the limit indicated is not remote and when it is not a substitute of the Ablative -5th case affix.\n\nTerms: एनप् (एन)", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["एनबन्यतरस्यामदूरेऽपञ्चम्याः ५.३.३५", "५.३.३५", "५.३.३५ एनबन्यतरस्यामदूरेऽपञ्चम्याः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["enabanyatarasyAmadUre'paYcamyAH ५.३.३५", "५.३.३५", "५.३.३५ enabanyatarasyAmadUre'paYcamyAH"]}]}